The public Ed25519 keys that sign tagave releases (release-manifest.json.sig),
one PEM file each. They are copied into the updater and app images, and the
first one is also embedded in install-tagave.sh (RELEASE_PUBLIC_KEY). The
private key lives only in the "release" environment of the GitHub repository
(secret TAGAVE_RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY). docs/security.md, "Signed releases",
explains how to check a release with them and how a key is replaced.
